        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發送時，%@ 的只讀快照將與此聊天共享。可在電腦操作設置中管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A registered webhook blocks long polling with 409 conflicts. Removing the webhook keeps pending updates and hands receive back to long polling.": {
