    "Automatic destinations come from your channel setup and always ask before sending. Each agent's destinations are also editable in its own settings, under Channels.": {
      "comment": "A description of the automatic destinations section.",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatische Ziele stammen aus deiner Kanal-Einrichtung und fragen vor dem Senden immer nach. Die Ziele jedes Agenten lassen sich auch in dessen eigenen Einstellungen unter „Kanäle“ bearbeiten."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "자동 대상은 채널 설정에서 만들어지며 전송 전에 항상 확인을 요청합니다. 각 에이전트의 대상은 해당 에이전트 설정의 채널 탭에서도 편집할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Автоматические назначения берутся из настройки каналов и всегда спрашивают перед отправкой. Назначения каждого агента также можно править в его собственных настройках, в разделе «Каналы»."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动目标来自频道设置，发送前总会先询问。每个智能体的目标也可以在其自身设置的“频道”中编辑。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動目標來自頻道設定，傳送前總會先詢問。每個智能體的目標也可以在其自身設定的「頻道」中編輯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic destinations come from your channel setup and always ask first. Each agent's destinations are also editable in its own settings, under Channels.": {
      "comment": "A description of the automatic destinations section.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
