    },
    "Every document has a category, so agents can filter the library by it. Categories come from frontmatter `type:` or are inferred automatically from folder names.": {
      "comment": "Help text for the \"Knowledge\" collection card, explaining that each document in the collection must have a category, which can be specified in the frontmatter or inferred from the folder name.",
