    "Files created by this chat will be removed, and edited or deleted files restored to their previous state. Changes made outside this chat are never overwritten.": {
      "comment": "Message in the confirmation overlay for undoing all chat-related workspace changes.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Files created by this chat will be removed, and edited or deleted files restored to their previous state. Changes made outside this chat are never overwritten."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Files created by this chat will be removed, and edited or deleted files restored to their previous state. Changes made outside this chat are never overwritten."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Files created by this chat will be removed, and edited or deleted files restored to their previous state. Changes made outside this chat are never overwritten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此聊天创建的文件将被删除，编辑或删除的文件将恢复到之前的状态。在此聊天之外所做的更改永远不会被覆盖。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此聊天建立的檔案將被刪除，編輯或刪除的檔案將恢復到先前的狀態。在此聊天之外所做的更改永遠不會被覆蓋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files in this folder are indexed in place and never modified. Markdown, plain text, code, and documents (PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, CSV) are supported; YAML frontmatter (`type`, `tags`, …) in markdown is used for filtering.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dateien in diesem Ordner werden an Ort und Stelle indiziert und nie verändert. Unterstützt werden Markdown, reiner Text, Code und Dokumente (PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, CSV); YAML-Frontmatter (`type`, `tags`, …) in Markdown dient zum Filtern."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 폴더의 파일은 제자리에서 색인되며 절대 수정되지 않습니다. 마크다운, 일반 텍스트, 코드, 문서(PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, CSV)를 지원하며, 마크다운의 YAML 프런트매터(`type`, `tags` 등)는 필터링에 사용됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Файлы в этой папке индексируются на месте и никогда не изменяются. Поддерживаются Markdown, обычный текст, код и документы (PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, CSV); YAML-заголовок (`type`, `tags`, …) в Markdown используется для фильтрации."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件夹中的文件将就地建立索引，绝不会被修改。支持 Markdown、纯文本、代码和文档（PDF、Word、Excel、PowerPoint、CSV）；Markdown 中的 YAML frontmatter（`type`、`tags` 等）用于筛选。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此資料夾中的檔案將就地建立索引，絕不會被修改。支援 Markdown、純文字、程式碼與文件（PDF、Word、Excel、PowerPoint、CSV）；Markdown 中的 YAML frontmatter（`type`、`tags` 等）用於篩選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
