    "For faster, higher-quality results, connect a provider like Tavily or Exa in the new Search tab — most have free tiers. Providers are tried in your order, with free sources as backup, and you can test any query right from settings.": {
      "comment": "What's New page body for connecting a search provider (0.21.11).",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "For faster, higher-quality results, connect a provider like Tavily or Exa in the new Search tab — most have free tiers. Providers are tried in your order, with free sources as backup, and you can test any query right from settings."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "For faster, higher-quality results, connect a provider like Tavily or Exa in the new Search tab — most have free tiers. Providers are tried in your order, with free sources as backup, and you can test any query right from settings."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "For faster, higher-quality results, connect a provider like Tavily or Exa in the new Search tab — most have free tiers. Providers are tried in your order, with free sources as backup, and you can test any query right from settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要获得更快、更高质量的结果，请在新的搜索标签页中连接 Tavily 或 Exa 等提供商 — 大多数提供商都有免费套餐。提供商按你的顺序依次尝试，免费来源作为备选，你可以直接在设置中测试任意查询。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要獲得更快、更高品質的結果，請在新的搜尋標籤頁中連線 Tavily 或 Exa 等供應商 — 大多數供應商都有免費方案。供應商依您的順序依次嘗試，免費來源作為備選，您可以直接在設定中測試任意查詢。"
          }
        }
      }
