    "Hey! After 10 months of building in public, today is our official launch on Product Hunt.\n\nOsaurus has been shaped by feedback from people like you. If it's been useful to you, come say hi and support the launch. It means a lot to us.\n\nThank you for being here early.": {
      "comment": "The body text of the \"We're live on",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Hey! After 10 months of building in public, today is our official launch on Product Hunt.\n\nOsaurus has been shaped by feedback from people like you. If it's been useful to you, come say hi and support the launch. It means a lot to us.\n\nThank you for being here early."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Hey! After 10 months of building in public, today is our official launch on Product Hunt.\n\nOsaurus has been shaped by feedback from people like you. If it's been useful to you, come say hi and support the launch. It means a lot to us.\n\nThank you for being here early."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Hey! After 10 months of building in public, today is our official launch on Product Hunt.\n\nOsaurus has been shaped by feedback from people like you. If it's been useful to you, come say hi and support the launch. It means a lot to us.\n\nThank you for being here early."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "嘿！经过 10 个月的公开开发，今天我们在 Product Hunt 上正式发布了。\n\nOsaurus 因为像你这样的人的反馈而变得更好。如果它对你有帮助，来打个招呼并支持这次发布吧。这对我们意义重大。\n\n感谢你早期的支持。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "嘿！經過 10 個月的公開建設，今天我們在 Product Hunt 上正式發佈了。\n\nOsaurus 因為像你這樣的人的回饋而變得更好。如果它對你有幫助，來打個招呼並支援這次發佈吧。這對我們意義重大。\n\n感謝你早期的支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
