    "Osaurus supports MLX-compatible Hugging Face repositories, including MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ, and TurboQuant artifacts when required files are present.": {
      "comment": "Informative text in an alert displayed when a user tries to open a model in Osaurus that is not MLX-compatible.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus unterstützt MLX-kompatible Hugging-Face-Repositories, einschließlich MLX-, MXFP-, JANG-, JANGTQ- und TurboQuant-Artefakten, sofern die erforderlichen Dateien vorhanden sind."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus는 필수 파일이 있는 경우 MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ 및 TurboQuant 아티팩트를 포함하여 MLX 호환 Hugging Face 저장소를 지원합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus поддерживает MLX-совместимые репозитории Hugging Face, включая артефакты MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ и TurboQuant, если присутствуют необходимые файлы."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus 支持兼容 MLX 的 Hugging Face 仓库，在所需文件齐全时也包括 MLX、MXFP、JANG、JANGTQ 和 TurboQuant 工件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osaurus 支持兼容 MLX 的 Hugging Face 倉庫，包括在具備所需文件時的 MLX、MXFP、JANG、JANGTQ 和 TurboQuant 工件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
