    "Paste the 24-word recovery phrase from your other Mac to restore your identity here. If iCloud Keychain is enabled on both Macs, the identity usually syncs on its own — the phrase is only needed when it doesn't.": {},
    "Paste the 24-word recovery phrase of the identity you want to switch to. This replaces the identity currently on this Mac.": {},
    "Paste the 24-word recovery phrase you saved during onboarding. We'll restore the original master key and your existing agents and access keys will start working again.": {
      "comment": "A description of the purpose of the recovery phrase field.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge die 24-Wörter-Wiederherstellungsphrase ein, die du beim Onboarding gespeichert hast. Wir stellen den ursprünglichen Hauptschlüssel wieder her, und deine vorhandenen Agenten und Zugriffsschlüssel funktionieren wieder."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "시작하기 중에 저장한 24단어 복구 구문을 붙여넣으세요. 원래 마스터 키를 복원하면 기존 에이전트와 액세스 키가 다시 작동하기 시작합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Вставьте фразу восстановления из 24 слов, которую вы сохранили во время регистрации. Мы восстановим исходный мастер-ключ, и ваши существующие агенты и ключи доступа снова начнут работать."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴你在初始设置时保存的 24 个词恢复助记词。我们将恢复原始主密钥，你现有的智能体和访问密钥将重新开始工作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘貼你在初始設置時保存的 24 個詞恢復助記詞。我們將恢復原始主密鑰，你現有的智能體和訪問密鑰將重新開始工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
