    "Read every reply aloud automatically after streaming completes. For on-request only, use the Speak Tool feature instead.": {
      "comment": "A description of the auto-speak feature, emphasizing its purpose and the alternative on-request feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Read every reply aloud automatically after streaming completes. For on-request only, use the Speak Tool feature instead."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "스트리밍이 완료된 후 모든 답장을 자동으로 소리 내어 읽습니다. 요청 시에만 사용하려면 말하기 도구 기능을 대신 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Автоматически зачитывайте каждый ответ вслух после завершения потоковой передачи. Только по запросу вместо этого используйте функцию Speak Tool."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "流式输出完成后自动朗读每条回复。如只需按需朗读，请改用“朗读工具”功能。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放完成後自動大聲朗讀每條回復。僅限點播使用，請使用「朗讀工具」功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read from the active model's bundle metadata and shown in that chat's Context Budget popover.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
