    "Reading and ordinary navigation run automatically, following your Computer Use autonomy level — but typing pauses for your approval, and submitting, purchasing, sending, or clearing data always asks first. Sign-ins happen in a window you type into directly, so agents never see your passwords. And you can stop a run any time from the feed.": {
      "comment": "What's New (0.22.9) page body — Browser Use safety.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Reading and ordinary navigation run automatically, following your Computer Use autonomy level — but typing pauses for your approval, and submitting, purchasing, sending, or clearing data always asks first. Sign-ins happen in a window you type into directly, so agents never see your passwords. And you can stop a run any time from the feed."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Reading and ordinary navigation run automatically, following your Computer Use autonomy level — but typing pauses for your approval, and submitting, purchasing, sending, or clearing data always asks first. Sign-ins happen in a window you type into directly, so agents never see your passwords. And you can stop a run any time from the feed."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Reading and ordinary navigation run automatically, following your Computer Use autonomy level — but typing pauses for your approval, and submitting, purchasing, sending, or clearing data always asks first. Sign-ins happen in a window you type into directly, so agents never see your passwords. And you can stop a run any time from the feed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阅读与常规导航自动运行，遵循你设定的电脑操控自主级别——但输入操作会暂停并等待你批准，提交、购买、发送或清除数据则始终会先行询问。登录在你直接输入的窗口中完成，智能体不会看到你的密码。你可随时从信息流中停止运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閱讀和常規導航自動執行，遵循您的電腦使用自主級別 — 但輸入操作會暫停等待您批准，而提交、購買、發送或清除資料始終會先詢問。登入操作在您直接輸入的視窗中進行，智慧體永遠不會看到您的密碼。您可以隨時從資訊流中停止執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
