          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要輔助功能權限。請授予該權限，並在「設置 > 電腦操作」中查看狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requires louder speech, faster response": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erfordert lauteres Sprechen, schnellere Reaktion"
