    "The agent adds rows when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat, or import a file.": {
      "comment": "Description of what happens when a table is empty.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The agent adds rows when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat, or import a file."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The agent adds rows when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat, or import a file."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The agent adds rows when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat, or import a file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体在有需要记住的内容时会添加行。你也可以直接在聊天中询问，或导入文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能體在有需要記住的內容時會新增行。你也可以直接在聊天中詢問，或匯入檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent adds rows with `db_insert` / `db_upsert` when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Agent fügt mit `db_insert` / `db_upsert` Zeilen hinzu, wenn er sich etwas merken möchte. Du kannst ihn auch direkt im Chat fragen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "에이전트는 기억할 내용이 있을 때 `db_insert` / `db_upsert`를 사용하여 행을 추가합니다. 채팅에서 직접 요청할 수도 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Агент добавляет строки с `db_insert`/`db_upsert`, когда ему есть что запомнить. Вы также можете задать это прямо в чате."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当智能体有需要记住的内容时，会使用 `db_insert` / `db_upsert` 添加行。你也可以在聊天中直接请求它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
