    "The manifest already enables Socket Mode and the message event subscriptions. You never enter a Request URL — Osaurus receives events over an outgoing connection.": {
      "comment": "A description of how the recommended Slack app manifest works.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The manifest already enables Socket Mode and the message event subscriptions. You never enter a Request URL — Osaurus receives events over an outgoing connection."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The manifest already enables Socket Mode and the message event subscriptions. You never enter a Request URL — Osaurus receives events over an outgoing connection."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The manifest already enables Socket Mode and the message event subscriptions. You never enter a Request URL — Osaurus receives events over an outgoing connection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清单已启用 Socket Mode 和消息事件订阅。你无需输入请求 URL — Osaurus 通过出站连接接收事件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定檔已啟用 Socket Mode 和訊息事件訂閱。您無需輸入請求 URL — Osaurus 通過出站連線接收事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The manifest marks the bot as always online so it shows a green presence dot in Slack. For an existing app, reapply the manifest under “App Manifest” on api.slack.com/apps — the flag only takes effect after the manifest is saved again.": {
      "comment": "A description of how to configure a Slack app manifest.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
