    "This is optional — agents can still search and read these documents. To let agents filter by category, move them into a folder (the folder name becomes the category) or add a `type:` line to their frontmatter.\n\n": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "This is optional — agents can still search and read these documents. To let agents filter by category, move them into a folder (the folder name becomes the category) or add a `type:` line to their frontmatter.\n\n"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "This is optional — agents can still search and read these documents. To let agents filter by category, move them into a folder (the folder name becomes the category) or add a `type:` line to their frontmatter.\n\n"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
