    },
    "This removes the \"%@\" channel definition from the configuration file. Keychain secrets it references are not deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "This removes the \"%@\" channel definition from the configuration file. Keychain secrets it references are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "This removes the \"%@\" channel definition from the configuration file. Keychain secrets it references are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "This removes the \"%@\" channel definition from the configuration file. Keychain secrets it references are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将从配置文件中移除 “%@” 频道定义。其引用的钥匙串密钥不会被删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這將從設定檔中移除 \"%@\" 頻道定義。其引用的鑰匙圈金鑰不會被刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the collection and its search index from Osaurus. The folder and its files on disk are not touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies entfernt die Sammlung und ihren Suchindex aus Osaurus. Der Ordner und seine Dateien auf der Festplatte bleiben unberührt."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 작업은 Osaurus에서 컬렉션과 검색 색인을 제거합니다. 디스크의 폴더와 파일은 그대로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Это удалит коллекцию и её поисковый индекс из Osaurus. Папка и её файлы на диске останутся нетронутыми."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将从 Osaurus 中移除该集合及其搜索索引。磁盘上的文件夹及其文件不会受到影响。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這將從 Osaurus 中移除該集合及其搜尋索引。磁碟上的資料夾及其檔案不會受到影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the memory from future recall while keeping the row available for diagnostics.": {
      "comment": "Message for a pending memory console action to disable a memory.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Dadurch wird der Speicher von zukünftigen Rückrufaktionen entfernt, während die Zeile für die Diagnose verfügbar bleibt."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 작업은 진단을 위해 행을 유지하면서 향후 회상에서 메모리를 제거합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Это удаляет память из будущего вызова, сохраняя при этом строку доступной для диагностики."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会将记忆从未来检索中移除，同时保留该行以便诊断。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會將記憶從未來檢索中移除，同時保留該行以便診斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes this response from the conversation. It won't be sent to the model on later turns.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dadurch wird diese Antwort aus der Unterhaltung entfernt. Sie wird bei späteren Nachrichten nicht an das Modell gesendet."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 응답을 대화에서 삭제합니다. 이후 대화에서 모델에 전송되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот ответ будет удалён из беседы. В последующих запросах он не будет отправляться модели."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会将此回复从对话中删除。在后续对话中不会发送给模型。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會將此回覆從對話中刪除。在後續對話中不會傳送給模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This repo could not be verified as an MLX-compatible model. Private repos require a connected Hugging Face token with access; all repos need config, tokenizer, and model weights.": {
      "comment": "Error message displayed when a Hugging Face repo is not MLX-compatible.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "This repo did not pass the MLX-compatible metadata/file check. Use an MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ, or TurboQuant repo with config, tokenizer, and model weights.": {
      "comment": "Error message displayed in the Hugging Face import sheet when a repo is found that is not MLX-compatible.",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Repo hat die MLX-kompatible Metadaten-/Dateiprüfung nicht bestanden. Verwende ein MLX-, MXFP-, JANG-, JANGTQ- oder TurboQuant-Repo mit Konfiguration, Tokenizer und Modellgewichten."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 저장소는 MLX 호환 메타데이터/파일 검사를 통과하지 못했습니다. 구성, 토크나이저 및 모델 가중치가 포함된 MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ 또는 TurboQuant 저장소를 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот репозиторий не прошёл проверку метаданных и файлов на совместимость с MLX. Используйте репозиторий MLX, MXFP, JANG, JANGTQ или TurboQuant с конфигурацией, токенизатором и весами модели."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此仓库未通过 MLX 兼容性元数据/文件检查。请使用包含配置、分词器和模型权重的 MLX、MXFP、JANG、JANGTQ 或 TurboQuant 仓库。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此倉庫未通過 MLX 兼容性元數據/文件檢查。請使用包含配置、分詞器和模型權重的 MLX、MXFP、JANG、JANGTQ 或 TurboQuant 倉庫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This response is part of a conversation summary, so deleting it may affect the meaning of later turns.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Antwort ist Teil einer Gesprächszusammenfassung. Das Löschen kann die Bedeutung späterer Nachrichten beeinflussen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 응답은 대화 요약의 일부이므로 삭제하면 이후 대화의 의미에 영향을 줄 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот ответ входит в сводку беседы, поэтому его удаление может повлиять на смысл последующих сообщений."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此回复是对话摘要的一部分，删除它可能会影响后续对话的含义。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此回覆是對話摘要的一部分，刪除它可能會影響後續對話的含義。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This room was turned off — for example its channel was removed, or it arrived from an imported file. Turn it back on to use it again.": {
      "comment": "A description of a disabled channel.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Raum wurde ausgeschaltet — zum Beispiel wurde sein Kanal entfernt oder er stammt aus einer importierten Datei. Schalte ihn wieder ein, um ihn erneut zu nutzen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 룸은 꺼져 있습니다. 예를 들어 채널이 제거되었거나 가져온 파일에서 생성된 경우입니다. 다시 사용하려면 다시 켜세요."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Эта комната была выключена — например, её канал удалён или она пришла из импортированного файла. Включите её снова, чтобы использовать."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此房间已被关闭——例如其频道已被移除，或它来自导入的文件。重新开启即可再次使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此房間已被關閉——例如其頻道已被移除，或它來自匯入的檔案。重新開啟即可再次使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server doesn't require authentication.": {
