    "This setup is loaded into the model before you start chatting.": {
      "comment": "Text describing how much of the model's working space is used by a setup before starting a chat.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "This text is inserted into the chat input when you select the command. You continue typing after it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Text wird in die Chat-Eingabe eingefügt, wenn du den Befehl auswählst. Du tippst danach weiter."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 텍스트는 명령을 선택할 때 채팅 입력에 삽입됩니다. 이어서 계속 입력할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот текст вставляется во ввод чата при выборе команды. Вы продолжаете печатать после него."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
